corpus/
# Desk-reference dictionaries (Matumo, the CASAS rhyming dictionary, the DBE maths
# dictionary, the Lexikos review) plus the raw Wiktionary dump. This repo is PUBLIC and
# GitHub Pages serves every tracked file, so the commercial books must never land in it —
# they are consulted locally, one entry at a time, to fill gaps in dict-bank.js
# (see SPEC-dictionary-panel.md §6). Megan's ruling, 2026-08-04.
dictionaries/
